  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development project design process with Srer Khmer organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a six-month project to support Srer Khmer to design a three-year community development project that will be different from others in terms of community ownership, incorporation of community led development approach, and documentation on evidence of changes occurred in rural communities. Through this project, Srer Khmer will be able to produce a clear and solid project proposal that is driven by genuine needs of target communities that will increase effectiveness of development project to support communities to address prioritised challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
